RoboTwin 2.0-Plus
=================

RoboTwin 2.0-Plus is a derivative work built on top of RoboTwin 2.0, extended with
LIBERO-Plus-style structured perturbation categories for evaluating the
robustness of Vision-Language-Action (VLA) policies.

