-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Bundled third-party components
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The policy/ directory vendors third-party VLA / imitation-learning baselines
(ACT, Diffusion Policy, DP3, RDT, pi0, OpenVLA-OFT, TinyVLA, DexVLA, and
others). Each retains its own upstream license and copyright; this repository
redistributes them for convenience only. Refer to each subdirectory for the
applicable license.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Summary of modifications vs. RoboTwin 2.0
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  envs/_base_task.py
      Sensor-noise / lighting / camera / robot-init perturbation dispatch,
      plus B1+/B2 background and O1+/O2 object perturbation parsing.
  envs/camera/camera.py
      Camera ablation support (C1/C2/C3).
  envs/utils/create_actor.py
      create_table() accepts surface_params for B2 material randomization.
  description/utils/generate_episode_instructions.py
      Language perturbation dispatch (R1 distraction + R2/R3).
  description/task_instruction_plus/*.json
      2,500 pre-generated R1/R2/R3 instruction variants (50 tasks x 50).
  task_config/demo_*.yml
      Perturbation configs for each dimension (see README.md).
